            {
              "content": "=You are a procurement assistant.\n\nCompare the eligible suppliers below and recommend ONE supplier.\n\nRules:\n1. Recommend the supplier with the LOWEST total_cost.\n2. Only consider suppliers already provided in the eligible suppliers list.\n3. Delivery speed is only a secondary factor and should be used only if two suppliers have the same total_cost.\n4. Never choose a more expensive supplier because it delivers faster.\n5. Keep the reason short and factual.\n\nEligible suppliers:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json.suppliers) }}\n\nReturn only valid JSON in this exact format:\n\n{\n  \"recommended_supplier\": \"Supplier name\",\n  \"total_cost\": 0,\n  \"delivery_days\": 0,\n  \"reason\": \"One short sentence\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
